OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening, some clear spells, frost
OL,7,Freturning for a time to many inland
OL,8,Fareas, but temperatures lifting
OL,9,Fovernight as winds pick up and patchy
OL,10,Frain reaches the west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FDry start in east otherwise
OL,13,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain turning
OL,14,Fheavier with some snow across the
OL,15,Fhills of Perthshire and the Trossachs,
OL,16,Fperhaps affecting higher level routes
OL,17,Flater. Windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
