OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith further rain and hill snow on
OL,7,FWednesday gradually easing. Mainly dry
OL,8,Fand bright on Thursday. Dry start
OL,9,FFriday then rain arriving from the west
